{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Vectoraid, you'll do more than just shoot asteroids. You'll dodge gravity wells and black holes whilst grabbing power-ups and defending other ships. You'll also fight giant, screen-filling bosses that with unique mechanics to master. You'll die. A lot. But you'll also unlock permanent upgrades, ship skins and engine trail cosmetics and become stronger with every run. Enjoy the arcade style bullet hell gameplay in a neon CRT visual style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Retro Vector Graphics</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All visuals are drawn in real-time, authentically recreating the classic arcade CRT screen feel but with modern visual effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/f5b4fb41abc7996d8d7c7d21c440d466.poster.avif?t=1762463700\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/f5b4fb41abc7996d8d7c7d21c440d466.webm?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/f5b4fb41abc7996d8d7c7d21c440d466.mp4?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Customise your ship</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each run you can choose from your unlocked ship skins and engine trails. Also select which special power to play with from 5 each with unique effects, power up your special meter by destroying asteroids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 12 Ship skins and 22 Engine trails to unlock as well as permanent stat boosts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/4c97642658a9e6660d07288cfbdf4136.avif?t=1762463700\" width=736 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Physics-Based Chaos</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master gravity wells, black holes, and wormholes to turn the environment into your ultimate weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/62fe4f1f78afa0de42f37f8c861e4a4f.poster.avif?t=1762463700\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/62fe4f1f78afa0de42f37f8c861e4a4f.webm?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/62fe4f1f78afa0de42f37f8c861e4a4f.mp4?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>15 Levels</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against 5 unique asteroid types (Armoured, Elite, Phased, Tethered &amp; more!), alien ships, and random environmental hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/b596cc77773e272503c20ebb6ff34b08.poster.avif?t=1762463700\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/b596cc77773e272503c20ebb6ff34b08.webm?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/b596cc77773e272503c20ebb6ff34b08.mp4?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>5 Boss Battles</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the unique mechanics to defeat 5 bosses, including the Colossus, Crystal Titan, the Alien Dreadship, and the final Super-Asteroid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/0be6ca2f5f428d986dbe27034f525d57.poster.avif?t=1762463700\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/0be6ca2f5f428d986dbe27034f525d57.webm?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/0be6ca2f5f428d986dbe27034f525d57.mp4?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Power-up Arsenal</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 12 unique power-ups that drop from enemies, from bombs and teleportation to spawning clones and detonating rainbow engine trails! Time your charged shots to combo with power-ups for extra effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/c90d05bdefa66bbaef2d8571c64412fd.poster.avif?t=1762463700\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/c90d05bdefa66bbaef2d8571c64412fd.webm?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/c90d05bdefa66bbaef2d8571c64412fd.mp4?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gauntlet Mode</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in an endless wave mode where survival unlocks exclusive cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/ac50f738bde98f00161d0e6ab6d41dda.poster.avif?t=1762463700\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/ac50f738bde98f00161d0e6ab6d41dda.webm?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/ac50f738bde98f00161d0e6ab6d41dda.mp4?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Local 1v1 Duel</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go head-to-head with a friend in a chaotic duel, spawning asteroids, meteors, and drone ships to crush your opponent! This can also be played on one steam deck, each player holding one side of the deck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Salvage mode</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract ore from the asteroids and transport it to the portal to teleport it out, if you survive 3mins your ore is turned into player EXP to level your profile up and unlock cosmetic rewards such as ship skins and engine trails! Choose from 3 different zones depending on your risk/reward appetite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/c5349a4b65a928285bb306ff2f0d3a30.poster.avif?t=1762463700\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/c5349a4b65a928285bb306ff2f0d3a30.webm?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/c5349a4b65a928285bb306ff2f0d3a30.mp4?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082580?t=1762463700","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082580?t=1762463700","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/380e48a82001b0c5c9c6fad36ee27beb157c1e06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762463700","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/380e48a82001b0c5c9c6fad36ee27beb157c1e06/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762463700","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Vectoraid, you'll do more than just shoot asteroids. You'll dodge gravity wells and black holes whilst grabbing power-ups and defending other ships. You'll also fight giant, screen-filling bosses that with unique mechanics to master. You'll die. A lot. But you'll also unlock permanent upgrades, ship skins and engine trail cosmetics and become stronger with every run. Enjoy the arcade style bullet hell gameplay in a neon CRT visual style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Retro Vector Graphics</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All visuals are drawn in real-time, authentically recreating the classic arcade CRT screen feel but with modern visual effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/f5b4fb41abc7996d8d7c7d21c440d466.poster.avif