</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against 5 unique asteroid types (Armoured, Elite, Phased, Tethered &amp; more!), alien ships, and random environmental hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/b596cc77773e272503c20ebb6ff34b08.poster.avif?t=1762463700\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/b596cc77773e272503c20ebb6ff34b08.webm?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/b596cc77773e272503c20ebb6ff34b08.mp4?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>5 Boss Battles</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the unique mechanics to defeat 5 bosses, including the Colossus, Crystal Titan, the Alien Dreadship, and the final Super-Asteroid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/0be6ca2f5f428d986dbe27034f525d57.poster.avif?t=1762463700\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/0be6ca2f5f428d986dbe27034f525d57.webm?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/0be6ca2f5f428d986dbe27034f525d57.mp4?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Power-up Arsenal</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 12 unique power-ups that drop from enemies, from bombs and teleportation to spawning clones and detonating rainbow engine trails! Time your charged shots to combo with power-ups for extra effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/c90d05bdefa66bbaef2d8571c64412fd.poster.avif?t=1762463700\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/c90d05bdefa66bbaef2d8571c64412fd.webm?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/c90d05bdefa66bbaef2d8571c64412fd.mp4?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gauntlet Mode</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in an endless wave mode where survival unlocks exclusive cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/ac50f738bde98f00161d0e6ab6d41dda.poster.avif?t=1762463700\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/ac50f738bde98f00161d0e6ab6d41dda.webm?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/ac50f738bde98f00161d0e6ab6d41dda.mp4?t=1762463700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Local 1v1 Duel</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go head-to-head with a friend in a chaotic duel, spawning asteroids, meteors, and drone ships to crush your opponent! This can also be played on one steam deck, each player holding one side of the deck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Salvage mode</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract ore from the asteroids and transport it to the portal to teleport it out, if you survi